{title: Aao Ni Saiyo Ral}
{artist: Jasbir Jassi}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#] Aao ni saiyo ral devo ni [G#] vadhaai,        [G#] Men var paaya raanjha [A#] maahi.
[A#] Aao ni saiyo.....        [A#] Ajj taan roz mubaarak chaddeya
[G#] Raanjha saade vedde [A#] vaddeya.        [A#] Hath khundi, modde kambal [G#] dhareya,
[A#] Chaakaan vaali shakal [G#] banayi.        [G#] Men var paaya raanjha [A#] maahi.
[A#] Aao ni saiyo ...        [A#] Bulle shah ik sauda keeta
[G#] Peeta, zehar piyaala [A#] peeta,        [A#] Na kujh laha tota [G#] leeta.
[A#] Dard dukhaan di gathari [G#] chaahi,        Aao saiyo ral deyo ni vadhai
[G#] Men var paaya raanjha [A#] maahi.        [A#] Aao ni saiyo ...
